---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /teams/
title: "How to watch every NBA team in 2026-27 | Local TV by team"
description: "All 30 NBA teams and their 2026-27 local TV and streaming homes, hand-checked with sources. See which teams moved after FanDuel Sports Network shut down."
---
<div class="wrap">
<p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Teams</p>
<h1 style="font-size:clamp(36px,5.5vw,64px)">Every team, <span class="acc">every channel.</span></h1>
<p class="lead">Tap a team for its season guide, next games and sources.</p>
{% include "tiles.njk" %}
<div class="sec"><h2>The full table</h2></div>
<div class="tscroll"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>Team</th><th>Local TV</th><th>Streaming</th><th>Free games</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{% for t in teams %}{% set l = t.slug | local %}<tr><td><span class="sw" style="background:{{ t.c1 }}"></span><a href="/teams/{{ t.slug }}/"><b>{{ t.full }}</b></a>{% if l.fdsn %} <span class="tag new">New home</span>{% endif %}</td><td>{{ l.tv }}</td><td>{{ l.stream }}</td><td>{{ l.free or "None announced" }}</td><td>{% if l.status == 'verified' %}<span class="tag ok">Verified</span>{% else %}<span class="tag unc">{{ "Partly unconfirmed" if l.status == 'partial' else "Unconfirmed" }}</span>{% endif %}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
</tbody></table></div>
</div>
